Z||000000||overlord||11-28-2000||08:05 AM||||after i got my headgasket fixed up and everyhting running sweet......i noticed my radiator fan doesnt seem to come on at all.<BR>It used to cause i could feel it..now nothing. My temp guage stays at the first notch most of the time...however if i sit for a few seconds it will go to the second notch..but never any higher.<BR>Should i even bother with it??????<BR>It doenst overheat (or anywhere near).||||reg||1
Z||000001||Fiero5||11-28-2000||11:27 AM||||A good test to see if the fan works at all, is while the car is running turn on your AC-if you have it. This will cause the fan to come on.||||reg||1
